* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 2
* <Natural Source Header
* NOSDOP-N - NOM System defaults * (system,monitor,report,bundle,
*     archiving,reviving,NAF,CMA Spool, API) /*SU10 ,SAP Spool defaults)
*        use ES-KEY-PARM(1) 'Y'/'N' bs2-copy modifiable/not mod.
*            ES-KEY-PARM(2) 'Y'/'N' bs2-rename modifiable/not mod.
* Maintenance:
* XSETGGR 2004-06-03 created
* XSETGGR 2005-05-11 NOM31 long records for all spool types
* XSETGGR 2005-06-27 reset flush-time in bundle defaults when store
*                    nrm-monitor record
* XSETGGR 2005-07-06 p(266530) Make mointor NPR mainframe independent
* XSETGGR 2007-03-22 replace call of ES...-N to direct call of module
* fhi     2007-07-12 NOM3202   C-NATERR changed, NAD23006 is obsolete.
* xsetggr 2007-09-11 NOM3201   Support 5 byte node numbers
* xsetggr 2008-09-09 p(308591) add steplibs
* XSETHZ  2008-11-21 p(309614) new nomexit
* fhi     2009-02-20 P300323   Use RGETSTEP to get steplibs
* fhi     2009-02-27 P300323 Rename RGETSTEP to NOMGSTEP delivered in SYSTEM
* fhi     2010-05-26 P325613 Enhance node number validation
* fhi     2010-09-03 NOMALL-97 Extend message line
* XSETHZ  2010-10-21 NOMALL-895 new nomexit014
* raya    2012-01-11 NOMALL-1096 add error-code/text to nomex007
* xsetggr 2012-05-17 NOMALL-1136 improve validation of printers
* xsetggr 2012-06-19 NOMALL-1163 correct validation of retention
* xsetggr 2012-08-04 NOMALL-78   disabled maintenance of long records
* bli     2012-09-25 NOMALL-94   delete old version check
* raya     2012-11-29 NOMALL-1214 check cat date of nomex*
* SU1     2013-01-31 unused      Deactivate unused data areas
* SU2     2013-03-26 NOMALL-82 V34:monitor defaults: new class: error
* SU3     2013-03-26 NOMALL-1260 V34: CMA Spool -> CA Spool
* SU4     2014-06-23 NOMALL-1281 show last update user
* CF1     2014-06-24 NOMALL-1284 Hold retention for printout
* SU5     2014-06-27 NOMALL-1281 let it work for CLEANUP,REVIVE
* CF2     2014-08-22 NOMALL-1474 Enable system defaults for NGC internal
* SU6     2014-11-17 NOMALL-1450 fill fields for Adabas Vista
* SU7     2015-02-09 NOMALL-1450 'ST'->'SI'
* fhi     2015-06-30 NOMALL-1655 Leave copies field as entered
* SU8     2016-01-20 NOMALL-1802 do not update Adabas Vista fields
* SU9     2016-09-29 NOM3.5 use N-NONE+N-SEPME2
* fhi     2016-11-10 NOMALL-1917 Use correct node number
* fhi     2016-11-11 NOMALL-1961 Duplicate monitor copy task
* BLI     2017-10-06 NOMALL-1477 z/OS archive w/o predefined volsers
* fhi     2017-10-09 NOMALL-1920 Use BS2000 Spool correctly
* CF3     2017-10-26 NOMALL-2050 Adapt Monitor Defaults to 3.5. struct.
*                                (rebuilt for the Monitor Defaults area)
* SU10     2018-04-27 NOMALL-1823 remove SAP
* CF4     2018-06-21 NOMALL-2050 Flag error if no Monitor record exists.
* CF5     2018-07-02 NOMALL-2050 Use new task ID also for DS, DR, DB.
* CF6     2018-07-04 NOMALL-2050 Provide next Cleanup date (funct. DS).
* CF7     2018-07-16 NOMALL-2123 Handle non-printable chars (BS2000).
* CF8     2018-11-14 NOMALL-2050 Add emergency emails to Monitor Def.
* CF9     2018-12-10 NOMALL-2189 Correct User Exit number and entries
* SU11    2019-02-05 NOMALL-2142 remove predefined volsers(def arc)
* CF10    2019-08-07 NOMALL-2300 Send (a) for emails on server to client
* SU12    2020-11-10 NOMALL-2440 split DDM -> NRM-MF-NODES
* SU13    2021-04-16 NOMALL-2454 recat RMTASK-P to avoid NAT1305
* SU14    2022-03-16 ES-32029    Spool Class "SYSOUT" optional
* SU15    2022-10-19 NOMALL-2583 check trigger DBID/FNR
* SU16    2024-03-07 ES-34613    NOM 3.6 Remove power / BS2 / SAP
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
